    "sub_name": "都市財政分析",
    "sub_ename": "URBAN FINANCE ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹同學明瞭都市財政的基本理論以及方法，以作為相關都市規劃實務分析之基礎。議題包含公共財及私人財貨、財務合理性分析與不動產開發等等。",
    "describe_eh": "The objective of this course is to prepare students with basic capability of conducting urban financial research. Topics discussed include public goods and private goods,  equity and efficiency in economical aspects, reasonability of the finance policy, real estate development, etc.\r\n",
